## AI vs Human Responsibility

### AI / Replit accelerated
- UI and React implementation
- Component creation
- Workflow implementation
- Code iteration and refactoring
- Visualization and navigation

### I defined and controlled
- Data Ops operating model
- KPI and evaluation strategy
- Stable / Seasonal / Edge-Case strategy
- Targeted data approach
- Agent responsibilities
- Human approval boundaries
- Acceptance criteria
- Final implementation decisions

> **AI accelerated implementation; it did not own the product decisions.**

