## Final Takeaway

The prompting journey was not:

**“Ask AI to build a dashboard.”**

It was:

**Define → Build → Review → Challenge → Refine → Validate**

The prototype evolved from a monitoring dashboard into an **AI-assisted Data Operations decision-support system** connecting:

**Production Signal → Model Gap → Targeted Data → Human/Vendor Execution → Evaluation → Model Improvement**
